WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.641
An agent sees what is waiting.

2
00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:10.449
Laura writes on WhatsApp, and her request arrives as a task with the reference and the time she asked for.

3
00:00:10.449 --> 00:00:12.635
The agent takes it.

4
00:00:12.635 --> 00:00:17.717
It is hers now. Nobody else can take it.

5
00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:22.392
Once it is done, it leaves the list.
